# Generated by `npm run gen:icons` (a pre-hook of dist:*), rendered from the
# sprite sheet. Ignored for the same reason as the tray icons: they are output,
# not artwork. The artwork is art/walder.json, and committing a binary derived
# from it only invites the two to drift apart.
build/icon.png
build/icon.icns
build/icon.ico
build/icon.iconset/
