graphify-out/
# Written by `python3 art/strips.py`: one copy of every resolved strip per coat
# set, so the Firefly-filename -> animation mapping is a folder you can flip
# through. Output, not artwork — the artwork is v4/ and the legacy exports one
# level up, both of which stay tracked. The flat `named/*.png` copies from 0.1.2
# also stay tracked: `docs/PROMPTS_V4.md` tells the owner to attach them as the
# golden references when he generates the dapple set.
design/references/strips/named/*/
